<h3>  Experienced brewing for one hundred years </h3> 
<div class="story line ">  </div> 
<p> 
Moon Tea & Coffee started with a simple dream: to make a space that would warm, 
refresh and truly bring happiness with each cup. With the spirit of the moon and 
the warmth of the camaraderie of a drink, we felt compelled to promote beverages 
prepared using the finest of tea leaves, top-notch coffee beans, and fresh fruits.
</p>
<p> 
Each recipe is carefully designed to create the ideal balance of taste, quality and 
consistency. From a refreshing fruit tea to a smooth milk tea and a rich cup of coffee, 
each coffee is made with care to make moments that you can share with family, friends and love.
</p>
<p> 
Today, Moon Tea and coffee is to continue to expand,and maintaining its original values at the same time 
</p> 
